_pr_legacy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is on branch `fix/money-banker-rounding`, CI passed, and pull request #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and FIN-212 call for banker's rounding.\n- **Change:** Switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. This is the only code change.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nThe standard `open_pr` endpoint returned 503 on every retry, so I opened the PR through `open_pr_legacy`, which is documented as having the same effect. I checked beforehand that no PR had been created. The PR has not been merged. Merging into main needs code-owner approval, so alex or another code owner will need to approve it.", "type": "text"}]}]}